fix(orders): retry stock reservation on serialization failures

Concurrent checkouts for the same SKU could fail with a PostgreSQL
serialization error, leaving orders stuck in "paid" without reserved
stock. The fulfillment worker now retries the reservation with
exponential backoff before requeueing the message.

- wrap StockLedger.reserve() in a SERIALIZABLE retry loop (max 5)
- add jittered backoff starting at 250ms
- emit `orders_reservation_retries_total` metric
- cover the race with a new integration test

Closes #231
